    src: https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Darius_I_statue_list_of_subject_countries.jpg/250px-Darius_I_statue_list_of_subject_countries.jpg
    width: 1459
    height: 2300
    caption: The 24 countries subject to the Achaemenid Empire at the time of
      Darius, on the Egyptian statue of Darius I.
  - file: Napoli_BW_2013-05-16_16-25-06_1_DxO.jpg
    src: https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Battle_of_Issus_mosaic_-_Museo_Archeologico_Nazionale_-_Naples_2013-05-16_16-25-06_BW.jpg/250px-Battle_of_Issus_mosaic_-_Museo_Archeologico_Nazionale_-_Naples_2013-05-16_16-25-06_BW.jpg
    width: 3562
    height: 2133
    caption: The Battle of Issus, between Alexander the Great on horseback to the
      left, and Darius III in the chariot to the right, represented in a
      Pompeii mosaic dated 1st century BC – Naples National Archaeological
      Museum
  - file: Alexander’s_first_victory_over_Darius,_the_Persian_king.jpg
    src: https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/Alexander%E2%80%99s_first_victory_over_Darius%2C_the_Persian_king.jpg/250px-Alexander%E2%80%99s_first_victory_over_Darius%2C_the_Persian_king.jpg
    width: 800
    height: 539
    caption: Alexander's first victory over Darius, the Persian king depicted in
      medieval European style in the 15th century romance The History of
      Alexander's Battles
  - file: KINGS_of_PERSIS._Vādfradād_(Autophradates)_I._3rd_century_BC.jpg
    src: https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/KINGS_of_PERSIS._V%C4%81dfrad%C4%81d_%28Autophradates%29_I._3rd_century_BC.jpg/250px-KINGS_of_PERSIS._V%C4%81dfrad%C4%81d_%28Autophradates%29_I._3rd_century_BC.jpg
    width: 800
    height: 382
    caption: Frataraka dynasty ruler Vadfradad I (Autophradates I). 3rd century
      BC. Istakhr (Persepolis) mint.
  - file: KINGS_of_PERSIS._Dārēv_(Darios)_I._2nd_century_BC.jpg
    src: https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/KINGS_of_PERSIS._D%C4%81r%C4%93v_%28Darios%29_I._2nd_century_BC.jpg/250px-KINGS_of_PERSIS._D%C4%81r%C4%93v_%28Darios%29_I._2nd_century_BC.jpg
    width: 800
    height: 410
