    width: 600
    height: 877
    caption: Winged sphinx from the Palace of Darius in Susa, Louvre museum
  - file: Map_of_Achaemenid_Imperial_Satraps_(English_Version).png
    src: https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/Map_of_Achaemenid_Imperial_Satraps_%28English_Version%29.png/500px-Map_of_Achaemenid_Imperial_Satraps_%28English_Version%29.png
    width: 3308
    height: 1648
