    height: 1688
    caption: An Achaemenid rhyton, or drinking vessel
  - file: 201312_iran_Shiraz_72_(12475982935).jpg
    src: https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/201312_iran_Shiraz_72_%2812475982935%29.jpg/250px-201312_iran_Shiraz_72_%2812475982935%29.jpg
    width: 4000
    height: 3000
    caption: A bas-relief of Farvahar at Persepolis
  - file: History_History_Travel_from_Shiraz_to_Isfahan,_Iran_(26376451617).jpg
    src: https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/History_History_Travel_from_Shiraz_to_Isfahan%2C_Iran_%2826376451617%29.jpg/250px-History_History_Travel_from_Shiraz_to_Isfahan%2C_Iran_%2826376451617%29.jpg
    width: 2999
