  - file: Iran,_Persepolis,_Tomb_of_Artaxerxes_III.jpg
    src: https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/Iran%2C_Persepolis%2C_Tomb_of_Artaxerxes_III.jpg/250px-Iran%2C_Persepolis%2C_Tomb_of_Artaxerxes_III.jpg
    width: 4288
    height: 2848
    caption: The tomb of Artaxerxes III in Persepolis
  - file: The_maussolleion_model_dsc02711-miniaturk_nevit.jpg
    src: https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/The_maussolleion_model_dsc02711-miniaturk_nevit.jpg/250px-The_maussolleion_model_dsc02711-miniaturk_nevit.jpg
    width: 1944
    height: 2592
