    file names were available. Their caption text is kept in the section
    bodies as short lists so that nothing written is lost: the two Darius Vase
    photographs in "Cultural phase and Zoroastrian reforms", the Apadana gold
    foundation tablets and the gold deposition plate in "Languages" (carrying
